      "items": [
        {
          "type": "HTML",
          "html": "The older of the two Tikolo brothers in the Kenyan  squad,  David\nis  an  all  rounder,  capable of scoring useful runs, and taking\nuseful wickets with his medium pace bowling. He is also a  strong\nfielder.  He  has  played for Kenya in three ICC tournaments, and\nbrings considerable experience to the team."
